good.

here you have two options.
on the computer level <http://windows.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/change-system-locale#1TC=windows-7> which can affect other programs you are running (less recommended)
create an Rprofile.site file <http://www.statmethods.net/interface/customizing.html> in C:\Program Files\R\R-n.n.n\etc directory and put in there the line of code you ran before.
this way each time r starts it will run that code for you automatically. (better solution)

yoni

